<title>NORWAY: Norway jobless rate fell to 3.8 pct in February.</title>
<headline>Norway jobless rate fell to 3.8 pct in February.</headline>
<dateline>OSLO 1997-02-27</dateline>
<text>
<p>Norway's Labour directorate issued the following economic indicator.</p>
<p> NORWEGIAN UNEMPLOYMENT	 FEB 1997   JAN 1997    FEB 1996</p>
<p> Unemployment (in pct)	     3.8	  4.1	  4.5</p>
<p> Unemployed			  83,600	90,100     97,723</p>
<p>SEASONALLY ADJUSTED FIGURES</p>
<p>Unemployed			  82,982     85,161     92,370</p>
<p>NOTE -- Statistics Norway said 3.8 percent was the lowest February unemployment figure since 1988.</p>
<p>--Oslo newsroom, +47 22 42 50 41</p>
</text>
